# AutoMate

**Multi-shop vehicle service booking, price comparison and reminder app for Android.**

AutoMate brings multiple vehicle service centres together on one platform. Customers find nearby centres, compare services, prices and ratings for their own vehicle, book a convenient time slot, pay by bank transfer, track the booking and keep a full service history. Service centres manage their own services, prices, time slots and bookings, and an admin keeps the platform trustworthy.

> **Status:** In development – EC5208 Mobile Application Development group project, University of Ruhuna (Department of Electrical and Information Engineering).
> Final submission: 15 December 2026.

