## Contributing / Git Workflow

- `main` – stable, demo-ready code only
- `develop` – integration branch
- `feature/<name>` – one branch per feature (e.g. `feature/nearby-search`)
- Commit small and often with meaningful messages (e.g. `feat: add slot reservation transaction`)
- Open a pull request into `develop`; at least one teammate reviews before merging
- Never commit secrets, keystores or personal API keys

